      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can provide you with a general breakdown of the pros and cons for both options. \n\nIssuing a statement supporting the bill: \n- Pros: May appease the vocal crowd and prevent further backlash from them, potentially saving your brand's reputation and sales.\n- Cons: May alienate your older customer base, damage relationships with those strongly opposed to the bill, and create a perception that your brand is biased or out of touch.\n\nStaying neutral: \n- Pros: Avoids taking a side and can maintain a more neutral, inclusive image, potentially keeping both sides of the argument satisfied.\n- Cons: May not provide clarity on your brand's stance, potentially leading to further criticism and perceived inconsistency, and failing to address the concerns of either side of the debate.",
